.SH "NAME"
probe::nfs.aop.set_page_dirty \- NFS client marking page as dirty
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
.sp
.nf
probe nfs\&.aop\&.set_page_dirty {}
.fi
.SH "VALUES"
.PP
\fI__page\fR
.RS 4
the address of page
.RE
.PP
\fIpage_flag\fR
.RS 4
page flags
.RE
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
.PP
This probe attaches to folio_mark_dirty (or legacy page\-dirty helpers)\&. Thus, this probe is going to fire on many other file systems in addition to the NFS client\&.
.SH SEE ALSO\n 
.IR tapset::nfs (3stap)
